.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
ThorVG implementation of the painter interface\&. 

Internal header\&. This is the backend that turns a draw command list into pixels, using ThorVG's software rasterizer\&. It renders into a CPU buffer the caller owns; getting that buffer onto a screen is \fBschultz_sdl\&.h\fP's job\&.
.PP
One backend serves every target\&. There is no GPU path to keep in sync\&.
.PP
\fBNot part of the host facing interface\&.\fP The rasterizer backend\&. A host binds to \fBschultz_api\&.h\fP; this header is the toolkit's own and may change without notice\&. 
.PP
Definition in file \fBschultz_thorvg\&.h\fP\&.
