.SS "int32_t schultz_thorvg_engine_init (uint32_t threads)"

.PP
Starts the ThorVG engine\&. Call once before creating any backend, and pair with schultz_thorvg_engine_term\&.
.PP
\fBParameters\fP
.RS 4
\fIthreads\fP Worker threads for the rasterizer\&. Pass 0 to rasterize on the calling thread, which is what bring up and deterministic tests want\&. 
.RE
.PP
\fBReturns\fP
.RS 4
SCHULTZ_OK, or SCHULTZ_ERR_INVALID_ARGUMENT when the engine refused to start\&. 
.RE
.PP

